{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794851586585,"sessionID":"ses_e1a82d918ffeSg4o2dc6d2Zt3H","part":{"partID":"prt_1e57dbd8a002xEzcTej2h05fPy","sessionID":"ses_e1a82d918ffeSg4o2dc6d2Zt3H","messageID":"msg_1e57dae17001gYaj0Utmbs0ZTL","type":"tool","id":"call_e2bab2adfe2849e8a6c2ff53","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && wc -l .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml && grep -n \"step_create_state_log\\|step_init_config\\|step_write_strategy\\|phase_init\\|step_reduce_state\\|step_update_config_status\\|step_synthesis\\|phase_synthesis\\|step_evaluate_convergence\\|step_graph_upsert\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | head -60"},"output":"    2340 .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml\n102:  trigger: \"At workflow START, before phase_init\"\n305:    description: \"Spawn fan-out lineages; skip and proceed to phase_init normally when single-executor\"\n311:      This step runs before phase_init, so pass the raw review_focus. fanout-run.cjs\n323:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n325:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n349:  phase_init:\n556:          open_run: \"Run step_create_state_log.command unchanged. With the hand-written log set aside, it opens the run from the moved config.\"\n587:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n720:      step_create_state_log:\n954:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1138:            when: \"Run once, immediately before control jumps to phase_synthesis: in if_existing_terminal_path, in the divergent pivot's if_failed and on_error branches, and in every confirm-mode manualStop exit (on_C) into phase_synthesis: both divergent pivot gates, gate_pre_iteration and the post-iteration gate. The auto three-errors stop (reason error) reaches it through if_existing_terminal_path. The duration stop in step_check_max_duration runs it