check_max_duration runs it, once, before its jump to phase_synthesis. Never run it when the pivot continues the loop.\"\n1257:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1301:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1304:                  skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1308:              skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1312:            skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1415:        on_C: { set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }, run_first: record_terminal_gates, proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n1750:      step_graph_upsert:\n1800:        on_C: { set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }, run_first: record_terminal_gates, proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n1816:  phase_synthesis:\n2161:      step_update_config_status:\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && wc -l .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml && grep -n \\\"step_create_state_log\\\\|step_init_config\\\\|step_write_strategy\\\\|phase_init\\\\|step_reduce_state\\\\|step_update_config_status\\\\|step_synthesis\\\\|phase_synthesis\\\\|step_evaluate_convergence\\\\|step_graph_upsert\\\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | head -60\"}"},"time":{"start":1794851585418,"end":1794851586585}}}}
