{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794851963397,"sessionID":"ses_e1a82d918ffeSg4o2dc6d2Zt3H","part":{"partID":"prt_1e58338c8001Q3vE0FtlvnBtXE","sessionID":"ses_e1a82d918ffeSg4o2dc6d2Zt3H","messageID":"msg_1e5832496001ZSDYC5FvCDIENs","type":"tool","id":"call_ae6ccbe0bc8a489ebf6ddbb2","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - fixes-11\ndescription: Review progress, dimension coverage, findings, and outcomes for the fixes-11 fan-out lineage of review pass eleven.\nversion: 1.11.0.13\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent state for the `fixes-11` detached fan-out lineage of review pass eleven. Read by the iteration executor at the start of every pass.\n\n### Usage\n\n- **Init:** populated from `deep-review-config.json`, `review-brief-11.txt` and `review-scope-11.txt`.\n- **Per iteration:** the executor reads Next Focus, reviews one dimension, writes `iterations/iteration-NNN.md`, updates this file, and hands the state record to the append gateway.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview pass eleven, area `fixes`, of `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`.\n\nScope (area TAB path from `review-scope-11.txt`):\n\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts`\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts`\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt`\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install.yaml`\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs`\n\nDiff base: `git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff 6d50afe6f39 2f3f893c153 -- <path>`; whole file read at `2f3f893c153`.\n\n---\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- No code changes; findings only.\n- Not re-reporting the recorded limits in `review-brief-11.txt`: the `:auto.md` suffix reading, the `node -e` arrow as a redirect, `isolation-check.sh` macOS-only, underscore emphasis not dropped, the two moved baseline rows judged without text, the open P2 list in `038-alignment-p1-remediation/scratch/alignment-final-dispositions.md`, and review pass ten's open P2 in `review-report.md` — unless a new input breaks them.\n- Not reading or printing holdout prompt text; holdout gates are read by count only.\n- Not reviewing the `routing` area (README intents main, hook mirror, security phrase) — owned by lineage `routing-11`.\n- Not running repo tooling that writes (`validate.sh`, `generate-context.js`, git writes).\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- `convergence.cjs` stop decision STOP_ALLOWED, or `maxIterations` 8 reached, whichever comes first.\n- Escalate instead of looping if three consecutive iterations fail, or if state files are corrupt.\n\n---\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n---\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n[Review angles that were investigated and definitively eliminated -- consolidated from iteration dead-end data]\n\n---\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\nIteration 1: correctness. Focus: `commandOnlyMentioned`'s one-sided single-quote strip and its interaction with `COMMAND_OR_LIST`; confirm quoted or-list refusals; then the doctor runtime list membership against `symlink-manifest.json`.\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- **Target pointers:** `command-attach.ts` (`commandOnlyMentioned` at 422-453, call sites at 259, 504), `command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` (markup cases at 172-190), `doctor-install-presentation.txt` (accepted answers at 65-78), `doctor-install.yaml` (inputs at 46, ask step at 58), `doctor-install-contract.test.cjs` (runtime assertion at 238-244).\n- **Behavior claims:** `commandOnlyMentioned` returns true when every occurrence of a command name carries a refusal or question lead, so `attachCommand` withholds an offer on a refusal/question. The doctor presentation must name the runtimes `symlink-manifest.json` offers, and the contract test derives that list from the manifest.\n- **Reuse and conventions:** quote folding already normalizes `“”‘’` to straight quotes; tests use `it.each` tables; the doctor contract test reads assets by path and parses YAML with `yaml`.\n- **Review risks and gaps:** the manifest carries eight runtimes including `dsh`; the engine rejects unknown runtime names at `symlink-engine.cjs:435-438`; `command-attach.ts` has a gitignored compiled copy under `runtime/dist/` that already carries the new line.\n\n---\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install.yaml` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs` | - | - | - | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 8\n- Convergence threshold: 0.10\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-fixes-11-1794851543294-mlt3r6, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 40 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-16T17:58:16.000Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"---\\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - fixes-11\\ndescription: Review progress, dimension coverage, findings, and outcomes for the fixes-11 fan-out lineage of review pass eleven.\\nversion: 1.11.0.13\\n---\\n\\n# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nPersistent state for the `fixes-11` detached fan-out lineage of review pass eleven. Read by the iteration executor at the start of every pass.\\n\\n### Usage\\n\\n- **Init:** populated from `deep-review-config.json`, `review-brief-11.txt` and `review-scope-11.txt`.\\n- **Per iteration:** the executor reads Next Focus, reviews one dimension, writes `iterations/iteration-NNN.md`, updates this file, and hands the state record to the append gateway.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nReview pass eleven, area `fixes`, of `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`.\\n\\nScope (area TAB path from `review-scope-11.txt`):\\n\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts`\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts`\\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt`\\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install.yaml`\\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs`\\n\\nDiff base: `git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff 6d50afe6f39 2f3f893c153 -- <path>`; whole file read at `2f3f893c153`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- No code changes; findings only.\\n- Not re-reporting the recorded limits in `review-brief-11.txt`: the `:auto.md` suffix reading, the `node -e` arrow as a redirect, `isolation-check.sh` macOS-only, underscore emphasis not dropped, the two moved baseline rows judged without text, the open P2 list in `038-alignment-p1-remediation/scratch/alignment-final-dispositions.md`, and review pass ten's open P2 in `review-report.md` — unless a new input breaks them.\\n- Not reading or printing holdout prompt text; holdout gates are read by count only.\\n- Not reviewing the `routing` area (README intents main, hook mirror, security phrase) — owned by lineage `routing-11`.\\n- Not running repo tooling that writes (`validate.sh`, `generate-context.js`, git writes).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- `convergence.cjs` stop decision STOP_ALLOWED, or `maxIterations` 8 reached, whichever comes first.\\n- Escalate instead of looping if three consecutive iterations fail, or if state files are corrupt.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\\n\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n\\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n[Review angles that were investigated and definitively eliminated -- consolidated from iteration dead-end data]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\nIteration 1: correctness. Focus: `commandOnlyMentioned`'s one-sided single-quote strip and its interaction with `COMMAND_OR_LIST`; confirm quoted or-list refusals; then the doctor runtime list membership against `symlink-manifest.json`.\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- **Target pointers:** `command-attach.ts` (`commandOnlyMentioned` at 422-453, call sites at 259, 504), `command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` (markup cases at 172-190), `doctor-install-presentation.txt` (accepted answers at 65-78), `doctor-install.yaml` (inputs at 46, ask step at 58), `doctor-install-contract.test.cjs` (runtime assertion at 238-244).\\n- **Behavior claims:** `commandOnlyMentioned` returns true when every occurrence of a command name carries a refusal or question lead, so `attachCommand` withholds an offer on a refusal/question. The doctor presentation must name the runtimes `symlink-manifest.json` offers, and the contract test derives that list from the manifest.\\n- **Reuse and conventions:** quote folding already normalizes `“”‘’` to straight quotes; tests use `it.each` tables; the doctor contract test reads assets by path and parses YAML with `yaml`.\\n- **Review risks and gaps:** the manifest carries eight runtimes including `dsh`; the engine rejects unknown runtime names at `symlink-engine.cjs:435-438`; `command-attach.ts` has a gitignored compiled copy under `runtime/dist/` that already carries the new line.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install.yaml` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs` | - | - | - | pending |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Max iterations: 8\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.10\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-fixes-11-1794851543294-mlt3r6, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\\n- Per-iteration budget: 40 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\\n- Started: 2026-11-16T17:58:16.000Z\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794851944648,"end":1794851963397}}}}
