{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794852700638,"sessionID":"ses_e1a82d918ffeSg4o2dc6d2Zt3H","part":{"partID":"prt_1e58ea213001Zclq6NAAy8quhK","sessionID":"ses_e1a82d918ffeSg4o2dc6d2Zt3H","messageID":"msg_1e58e9735001A9czDnQZPOYzbe","type":"tool","id":"call_3d6c5ee6d42b43aaa0ecd7fc","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n- Compiled-module probing: running the gitignored `runtime/dist` module against hand-built prompts proved the guard's real behavior instead of inferring it from source (iteration 1).\n- Manifest-anchored membership check: reading `symlink-manifest.json` and `symlink-engine.cjs:435-438` settled whether `dsh` is offerable (iteration 1).\n- Typed-name vs mapped-name control: guarding the retired `/create:skill` returns true while guarding `/create:sk-skill` returns false, which isolated the delivery bypass root cause (iteration 3).","oldString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n- Compiled-module probing: running the gitignored `runtime/dist` module against hand-built prompts proved the guard's real behavior instead of inferring it from source (iteration 1).\n- Manifest-anchored membership check: reading `symlink-manifest.json` and `symlink-engine.cjs:435-438` settled whether `dsh` is offerable (iteration 1).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-s