{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794852715152,"sessionID":"ses_e1a82d918ffeSg4o2dc6d2Zt3H","part":{"partID":"prt_1e58eedad001h45ieell3DyuCP","sessionID":"ses_e1a82d918ffeSg4o2dc6d2Zt3H","messageID":"msg_1e58ede16001ezblzecrYiJr9q","type":"tool","id":"call_aceaf2b729ba44ef9ec4c307","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- **Dimension:** maintainability. - **Focus area:** the contract test's redundant count assertion and its two runtime-list surfaces; the fold comment at `command-attach.ts:409-421` and its missing closing-quote note; the test table heading at `command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:172`. - **Reason:** the rotation's last dimension. - **Rotation status:** correctness, traceability and security reviewed; maintainability closes the rotation. - **Blocked/productive carry-forward:** security is productive; no approach is blocked. - **Required evidence:** exact assertion lines in the contract test, the comment block, and the test table heading.","oldString":"## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- **Dimension:** security. - **Focus area:** whether the mention guard can be evaded by quote placement to make the advisor offer or deliver a command the prompt refused, and whether the doctor install's printed writing commands can carry operator input beyond the values it validated. - **Reason:** the guard's purpose is to keep a mutating command from being offered on a refusal; iteration 1 found one reachable evasion, so the adversarial pass should map the family rather than add a second instance of it. - **Rotation status:** correctness and traceability reviewed; security next, maintainability last. - **Blocked/productive carry-forward:** traceability is productive (two P2s, both with a concrete mutation that keeps tests green); no approach is blocked. - **Required evidence:** compiled-module runs over quote/lead permutations (brace, quote, apostrophe, list joins), and the presentation's printed-command invariants at `doctor-install-presentation.txt:5` and `:139`. **Stop decision after iteration 1:** CONTINUE; `stopReason` none; `blockedBy` empty; the coverage gate names `security`, `traceability` and `maintainability` as the missing dimensions at that point, and `traceability` is now covered. Review verdict: CONDITIONAL","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -137,9 +137,9 @@\n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n ## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n-- **Dimension:** security. - **Focus area:** whether the mention guard can be evaded by quote placement to make the advisor offer or deliver a command the prompt refused, and whether the doctor install's printed writing commands can carry operator input beyond the values it validated. - **Reason:** the guard's purpose is to keep a mutating command from being offered on a refusal; iteration 1 found one reachable evasion, so the adversarial pass should map the family rather than add a second instance of it. - **Rotation status:** correctness and traceability reviewed; security next, maintainability last. - **Blocked/productive carry-forward:** traceability is productive (two P2s, both with a concrete mutation that keeps tests green); no approach is blocked. - **Required evidence:** compiled-module runs over quote/lead permutations (brace, quote, apostrophe, list joins), and the presentation's printed-command invariants at `doctor-install-presentation.txt:5` and `:139`. **Stop decision after iteration 1:** CONTINUE; `stopReason` none; `blockedBy` empty; the coverage gate names `security`, `traceability` and `maintainability` as the missing dimensions at that point, and `traceability` is now covered. Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n+- **Dimension:** maintainability. - **Focus area:** the contract test's redundant count assertion and its two runtime-list surfaces; the fold comment at `command-attach.ts:409-421` and its missing closing-quote note; the test table heading at `command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:172`. - **Reason:** the rotation's last dimension. - **Rotation status:** correctness, traceability and security reviewed; maintainability closes the rotation. - **Blocked/productive carry-forward:** security is productive; no approach is blocked. - **Required evidence:** exact assertion lines in the contract test, the comment block, and the test table heading.\n \n <!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n ## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n \n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"## 11. NEXT FOCUS\\n- **Dimension:** maintainability. - **Focus area:** the contract test's redundant count assertion and its two runtime-list surfaces; the fold comment at `command-attach.ts:409-421` and its missing closing-quote note; the test table heading at `command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:172`. - **Reason:** the rotation's last dimension. - **Rotation status:** correctness, traceability and security reviewed; maintainability closes the rotation. - **Blocked/productive carry-forward:** security is productive; no approach is blocked. - **Required evidence:** exact assertion lines in the contract test, the comment block, and the test table heading.\",\"oldString\":\"## 11. NEXT FOCUS\\n- **Dimension:** security. - **Focus area:** whether the mention guard can be evaded by quote placement to make the advisor offer or deliver a command the prompt refused, and whether the doctor install's printed writing commands can carry operator input beyond the values it validated. - **Reason:** the guard's purpose is to keep a mutating command from being offered on a refusal; iteration 1 found one reachable evasion, so the adversarial pass should map the family rather than add a second instance of it. - **Rotation status:** correctness and traceability reviewed; security next, maintainability last. - **Blocked/productive carry-forward:** traceability is productive (two P2s, both with a concrete mutation that keeps tests green); no approach is blocked. - **Required evidence:** compiled-module runs over quote/lead permutations (brace, quote, apostrophe, list joins), and the presentation's printed-command invariants at `doctor-install-presentation.txt:5` and `:139`. **Stop decision after iteration 1:** CONTINUE; `stopReason` none; `blockedBy` empty; the coverage gate names `security`, `traceability` and `maintainability` as the missing dimensions at that point, and `traceability` is now covered. Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794852711853,"end":1794852715152}}}}
