{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794853153097,"sessionID":"ses_e1a82d918ffeSg4o2dc6d2Zt3H","part":{"partID":"prt_1e59584ae001zNaLgOzj8611FX","sessionID":"ses_e1a82d918ffeSg4o2dc6d2Zt3H","messageID":"msg_1e59571f20018lHvp7zeUyiWMB","type":"tool","id":"call_a46a098e125a4c968d815819","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Review Iteration 008 — fixes-11\n\n**Lineage:** `fixes-11` (detached fan-out, review pass eleven)\n**Artifact dir:** `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11`\n**Session:** `fanout-fixes-11-1794851543294-mlt3r6`\n\n## Dispatcher\n\n- **Operator review focus (bound):** review pass eleven, area `fixes`, per `review/review-brief-11.txt`. This is the final pass before the iteration cap; it consolidated the seven active findings, re-checked the five scope paths one last time, and prepared the synthesis input.\n- **Dimension this iteration:** maintainability (final consolidation).\n- **Recovery directive:** `STUCK_RECOVERY` again after iteration 7; the loop is at its last iteration, so this pass consolidates rather than opens a direction.\n- **Dimensions planned:** all four covered.\n- **Steer file:** absent at iteration start.\n\n## Files Reviewed\n\n| File | Under |\n|------|-------|\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | maintainability |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | maintainability |\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt` | maintainability |\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install.yaml` | maintainability |\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs` | maintainability |\n\n## Findings - New\n\n### P0 Findings\n\nNone.\n\n### P1 Findings\n\nNone new; `FIX11-P1-001` and `FIX11-P1-002` remain active.\n\n### P2 Findings\n\nNone new.\n\n## Traceability Checks\n\nNo new protocol result. The run's core protocols are already recorded: `spec_code` partial (iterations 1, 2, 5, 7) and `checklist_evidence` partial (iterations 2, 5, 7), with file:line evidence.\n\n## Consolidation\n\n| Item | State |\n|------|-------|\n| Active findings | 7 — `FIX11-P1-001`, `FIX11-P1-002`, `FIX11-P2-001` … `FIX11-P2-005` |\n| Resolved findings | 0 |\n| Dimensions covered | 4 of 4 |\n| Scope files reviewed | 5 of 5, each under all four dimensions |\n| Core protocols | `spec_code` partial, `checklist_evidence` partial |\n| Stop arithmetic | iteration cap reached after this pass |\n\n## Integration Evidence\n\n- The registry, the six prior iteration narratives and the six delta files agree on seven active findings (two P1, five P2).\n- No reviewed file changed during the run; the only tracked modification outside the lineage directory is the shared observability log.\n- The doctor runtime set remains consistent across the manifest, engine, presentation and workflow; the quote and retired-name defects remain as recorded.\n\n## Edge Cases\n\n- **Cap vs convergence.** The loop accepted the cap rather than a converged stop: the rolling average had reached zero, but `dimensionCoverage` never derived a stop for the graph signal. The cap is a legal stop and the findings registry, not the signal, carries the verdict.\n- **Remediation ownership.** Every active finding is a code, test or evidence fix; none needs another review pass. The synthesis report names the follow-up path.\n\n## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces\n\n- No new defect surfaced in the final consolidation.\n- All five scope paths remain present, unmodified, and covered.\n- No holdout prompt text was read or printed in any iteration.\n\n## Ruled Out\n\n- **A further review direction inside this scope** — the last four passes produced no new finding, and the recovery replay tested the P2 set for upgrades without success.\n- **A state inconsistency at closure** — registry counts, iteration narratives and deltas agree.\n\n## Next Focus\n\n- **Dimension:** none.\n- **Focus area:** synthesis and remediation planning.\n- **Reason:** the iteration cap is reached; the next phase is synthesis.\n- **Rotation status:** complete.\n- **Blocked/productive carry-forward:** nothing blocked; scope saturated.\n- **Required evidence:** the iter-8 stop decision.\n\n**Stop decision after iteration 7:** STUCK_RECOVERY; `stopReason` stuckRecovery; `blockedBy` empty; the recovery directive was applied for a second time and the loop proceeded to this final pass.\n\nReview verdict: CONDITIONAL\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/iterations/iteration-008.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/iterations/iteration-008.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/iterations/iteration-008.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"# Review Iteration 008 — fixes-11\\n\\n**Lineage:** `fixes-11` (detached fan-out, review pass eleven)\\n**Artifact dir:** `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11`\\n**Session:** `fanout-fixes-11-1794851543294-mlt3r6`\\n\\n## Dispatcher\\n\\n- **Operator review focus (bound):** review pass eleven, area `fixes`, per `review/review-brief-11.txt`. This is the final pass before the iteration cap; it consolidated the seven active findings, re-checked the five scope paths one last time, and prepared the synthesis input.\\n- **Dimension this iteration:** maintainability (final consolidation).\\n- **Recovery directive:** `STUCK_RECOVERY` again after iteration 7; the loop is at its last iteration, so this pass consolidates rather than opens a direction.\\n- **Dimensions planned:** all four covered.\\n- **Steer file:** absent at iteration start.\\n\\n## Files Reviewed\\n\\n| File | Under |\\n|------|-------|\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | maintainability |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | maintainability |\\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt` | maintainability |\\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install.yaml` | maintainability |\\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs` | maintainability |\\n\\n## Findings - New\\n\\n### P0 Findings\\n\\nNone.\\n\\n### P1 Findings\\n\\nNone new; `FIX11-P1-001` and `FIX11-P1-002` remain active.\\n\\n### P2 Findings\\n\\nNone new.\\n\\n## Traceability Checks\\n\\nNo new protocol result. The run's core protocols are already recorded: `spec_code` partial (iterations 1, 2, 5, 7) and `checklist_evidence` partial (iterations 2, 5, 7), with file:line evidence.\\n\\n## Consolidation\\n\\n| Item | State |\\n|------|-------|\\n| Active findings | 7 — `FIX11-P1-001`, `FIX11-P1-002`, `FIX11-P2-001` … `FIX11-P2-005` |\\n| Resolved findings | 0 |\\n| Dimensions covered | 4 of 4 |\\n| Scope files reviewed | 5 of 5, each under all four dimensions |\\n| Core protocols | `spec_code` partial, `checklist_evidence` partial |\\n| Stop arithmetic | iteration cap reached after this pass |\\n\\n## Integration Evidence\\n\\n- The registry, the six prior iteration narratives and the six delta files agree on seven active findings (two P1, five P2).\\n- No reviewed file changed during the run; the only tracked modification outside the lineage directory is the shared observability log.\\n- The doctor runtime set remains consistent across the manifest, engine, presentation and workflow; the quote and retired-name defects remain as recorded.\\n\\n## Edge Cases\\n\\n- **Cap vs convergence.** The loop accepted the cap rather than a converged stop: the rolling average had reached zero, but `dimensionCoverage` never derived a stop for the graph signal. The cap is a legal stop and the findings registry, not the signal, carries the verdict.\\n- **Remediation ownership.** Every active finding is a code, test or evidence fix; none needs another review pass. The synthesis report names the follow-up path.\\n\\n## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces\\n\\n- No new defect surfaced in the final consolidation.\\n- All five scope paths remain present, unmodified, and covered.\\n- No holdout prompt text was read or printed in any iteration.\\n\\n## Ruled Out\\n\\n- **A further review direction inside this scope** — the last four passes produced no new finding, and the recovery replay tested the P2 set for upgrades without success.\\n- **A state inconsistency at closure** — registry counts, iteration narratives and deltas agree.\\n\\n## Next Focus\\n\\n- **Dimension:** none.\\n- **Focus area:** synthesis and remediation planning.\\n- **Reason:** the iteration cap is reached; the next phase is synthesis.\\n- **Rotation status:** complete.\\n- **Blocked/productive carry-forward:** nothing blocked; scope saturated.\\n- **Required evidence:** the iter-8 stop decision.\\n\\n**Stop decision after iteration 7:** STUCK_RECOVERY; `stopReason` stuckRecovery; `blockedBy` empty; the recovery directive was applied for a second time and the loop proceeded to this final pass.\\n\\nReview verdict: CONDITIONAL\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/fixes-11/iterations/iteration-008.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794853143726,"end":1794853153097}}}}
